{"id":"n14549-1-5","stage":3,"title":"볶음 · 炒菜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14549-1-5-1","ko":"시골에서 무를 보내왔는데 조림을 해서 먹을까?","zh":"乡下寄来了萝卜，要把它做成炖菜吃吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시골에서","meaning":"乡下，农村，乡村","explanation":"시골：乡下，农村，乡村；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시골","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62488","senseId":"1","lemma":"시골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무를","meaning":"萝卜","explanation":"무：萝卜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무","audio":"/audio/a367ab3717bfa4f8a3ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54831","senseId":"1","lemma":"무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내왔는데","meaning":"送来，寄来","explanation":"보내오다：送来，寄来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보내오다","audio":"/audio/d59a05175535f2d4de27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14504","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조림을","meaning":"炖菜","explanation":"조림：炖菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"조림","audio":"/audio/4f013b7c7c1d6f3faaa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75503","senseId":"1","lemma":"조림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8d3efc29ac663a71","term":"시골","zh":"乡下，农村，乡村","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3","entryId":"62488","definition":"离城市较远、人口稀少且开发不充分的地区。","pronunciation":["시골"]},{"id":"a367ab3717bfa4f8","term":"무","zh":"萝卜","audio":"/audio/a367ab3717bfa4f8a3ea.mp3","entryId":"54831","definition":"腌制辛奇所用的蔬菜，呈白色，手臂大小的根部长有羽状的叶子。","pronunciation":["무ː"]},{"id":"d59a05175535f2d4","term":"보내오다","zh":"送来，寄来","audio":"/audio/d59a05175535f2d4de27.mp3","entryId":"14504","definition":"使人或事物向着接收人一方移动过来。","pronunciation":["보내오다"]},{"id":"4f013b7c7c1d6f3f","term":"조림","zh":"炖菜","audio":"/audio/4f013b7c7c1d6f3faaa6.mp3","entryId":"75503","definition":"在肉类、鱼类或蔬菜里放入各种调料后，将其汤汁收干而成的食物。","pronunciation":["조림"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bdc3c19fceb7d95547f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14549-1-5-2","ko":"나는 조림보다는 볶음을 좋아해.","zh":"比起炖菜，我更喜欢炒菜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조림보다는","meaning":"炖菜","explanation":"조림：炖菜；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"조림","audio":"/audio/4f013b7c7c1d6f3faaa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75503","senseId":"1","lemma":"조림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볶음을","meaning":"炒菜","explanation":"볶음：炒菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"볶음","audio":"/audio/f764bae02d791e1d2203.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14549","senseId":"1","lemma":"볶음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해.","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4f013b7c7c1d6f3f","term":"조림","zh":"炖菜","audio":"/audio/4f013b7c7c1d6f3faaa6.mp3","entryId":"75503","definition":"在肉类、鱼类或蔬菜里放入各种调料后，将其汤汁收干而成的食物。","pronunciation":["조림"]},{"id":"f764bae02d791e1d","term":"볶음","zh":"炒菜","audio":"/audio/f764bae02d791e1d2203.mp3","entryId":"14549","definition":"将食物的水分几乎全部去掉，放入稍微加点油后的炒锅里，然后放到火上来回翻，使其变熟的烹饪方法；或指那样做成的食物。","pronunciation":["보끔"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dac33f2b9b52bd838a38.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.149,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14549","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["比起炖菜，我更喜欢炒菜。","乡下寄来了萝卜，要把它做成炖菜吃吗？","水是从高处流向低处的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["乡下寄来了萝卜，要把它做成炖菜吃吗？","水是从高处流向低处的。","比起炖菜，我更喜欢炒菜。"],"answer":2}]}
